\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5.1<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 23, 1999<br/>Beta 5.1</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20120405183515&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sheet_of_Paper_64a83b.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a sheet of paper.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 1.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Found in Thais Castle Library, Carlin, <a href=\"#/wiki/Desert%20Dungeon%20Library\">Desert Dungeon</a>, Green Claw Swamp, Drefia Necromancer Halls, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun%20Libraries\">Serpentine Tower Library</a>, Vandura, Svargrond, Yalahar and Roshamuul.<br/>It looks the same as a <a href=\"#/wiki/Crude%20Primitive%20Printout\">Crude Primitive Printout</a>, Narsai's List, <a href=\"#/wiki/Rita%27s%20Letter\">Rita's Letter</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Ransom%20Note\">Ransom Note</a>, a Sheet of Tracing Paper (Full), Shimun's List, Tefrit's List, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Torn%20Out%20Page\">Torn Out Page</a> and Yonan's List.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>Prior to Spring Patch 2012, it looked like this: <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Sheet of Paper (Old Sprite Pre-9.5)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sheet_of_Paper_Old_Sprite_Pre_9_5_f9c89f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Closets</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Containers\">Containers</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crude%20Primitive%20Printout\">Crude Primitive Printout</a></li><li>Documents and Papers</li><li>Drefia Library</li><li>Duplicate Sprites</li><li>Narsai's List</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ransom%20Note\">Ransom Note</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rita%27s%20Letter\">Rita's Letter</a></li><li>Sheet of Tracing Paper (Full)</li><li>Shimun's List</li><li>Tefrit's List</li><li>Thais Libraries</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Torn%20Out%20Page\">Torn Out Page</a></li><li>Utilities</li><li>Yonan's List</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["formorgar-mines-hoist-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"formorgar-mines-hoist-quest","quest":"Formorgar Mines Hoist Quest","step":"1-4","n":8,"title":"Abrir a caixa no último andar","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":32029,"y":31110,"z":11,"label":"Caixa com as in